---
title: Links
pagetitle: Links
description: 'Nützliche Links der Fahrschule Guth Bochum: Frage- und Testbogen, Bußgeldkatalog, Deutsche Unfallhilfe, TÜV Essen-Frillendorf, Tipps zum Führerschein, Preiswahrheit.'
subnav: ueberuns
breadcrumb_parents:
  - { label: Über Uns, href: /ueberuns/ }
---
<%= partial "partials/page_header" %>
<section class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-5xl px-4">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Nützliche <span class="text-primary">Links</span>!</h2>
  <ul class="card-glass mt-4 divide-y divide-base-content/10 rounded-box">
    <% data.links.links.each do |l| %>
      <li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-5 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <span class="font-semibold"><%= l.name %></span>
        <a class="link link-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 break-all text-sm" href="<%= l.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="<%= l.name %>"><%= icon :external, css: "size-4 shrink-0" %> <%= l.label %></a>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
</section>
